          "correctOptionId": "3",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Given: </strong>An uncertain number of the person is sitting in a straight line facing north</p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\">1) Anjali sits on the extreme left end of the row</p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\">2) Five people are sitting between Arun and Anjali</p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">3) The same number of people sit between Arun and Shruti as between Shruti and Anjali</p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/06/F2_Sagar%20Saxena_1.6.21_Pallavi_D1.png\" style=\"width: 245px; height: 71px;\" /></p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">4) Only three people sit between Rahul and Arun.</p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">5) Three-person sit between Ram and Rahul</p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/06/F2_Sagar%20Saxena_1.6.21_Pallavi_D2.png\" style=\"width: 506px; height: 197px;\" /></p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Case II</strong> gets eliminated as it does not follow condition no. 5 that three-person sit between Ram and Rahul</p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">6) Ravi is sitting to the immediate left of Ram</p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">7) Abhi sits second to the right of Ram</p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">8) Abhi sits fifth from the extreme right end of the row</p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/06/F2_Sagar%20Saxena_1.6.21_Pallavi_D3.png\" style=\"width: 693px; height: 72px;\" /></p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">9) Sanu sits second to the left of Aditya, who is an immediate neighbor of Rahul</p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">10) Not more than two people sit between Aditya and Arun</p>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">11) The same number of people sits between Abhi and Abhishek as between Abhishek and Arun</p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;\"><img src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/06/F2_Sagar%20Saxena_1.6.21_Pallavi_D4.png\" style=\"width: 782px; height: 74px;\" /></span></p>\n\n<p>Hence, <strong>21 people are sitting in a row.</strong></p>",
